    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as c1ec9b557019f03b42293ffc7d8bf571dffca0f54749c22ae43f55052183639e.",
      "Curves were manually digitized from the plotted traces on p. 3. Points are readings from the traces, not interpolated table values; plotted curve readings are approximate.",
      "The output and on-resistance figures do not state temperature on the figure. The datasheet electrical-characteristics heading states TJ = 25 degC unless otherwise specified, so the default interpretation is 25 degC with that qualification retained.",
      "The transfer figure explicitly contains 25 degC and 125 degC curves; both were retained with their temperature semantics.",
      "The capacitance table gives typical Ciss = 358 pF, Coss = 69.3 pF, and Crss = 58.5 pF at VDS = 10 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz. Values are converted to farads. The capacitance figure is a typical VDS sweep and does not state VGS or frequency on the figure; the tabulated bias is recorded as context.",
      "RDS(on) typical values are 20 mOhm at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 6 A and 25.5 mOhm at VGS = 2.5 V, ID = 5 A. Published maximum bounds are 28 mOhm and 38 mOhm respectively and are preserved here as extraction notes because the strict schema has one resistance record per test point.",
      "The gate-charge table gives typical Qg = 5.6 nC, Qgs = 0.8 nC, and Qgd = 1 nC at VDS = 10 V, ID = 3 A, VGS = 4.5 V. The plotted gate-charge curve uses VDS = 10 V and ID = 3 A and is retained separately.",
      "IDSS is specified as a maximum of 1 uA at VDS = 20 V and VGS = 0 V, TJ = 25 degC, but the strict schema has no IDSS field.",
      "Thermal data specifies RthetaJA maximum 78 K/W; RthetaJC is not specified. The strict schema has no thermal field.",
      "The datasheet is for a dual N-channel MOSFET in SOP-8. No datasheet revision is stated.",
      "All plotted values retain the datasheet polarity and are represented as positive magnitudes for this N-channel device."
    ],
